<title>SWEDEN: Trygg-Hansa sees cost cuts over 3-5 yrs.</title>
<headline>Trygg-Hansa sees cost cuts over 3-5 yrs.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Trygg-Hansa AB said on Friday that the current pace of cost cutting is seen continuing for the next three to five years.</p>
<p>&quot;We certainly believe for the coming three to five years we will be able to maintain this relative level of cutting,&quot; the company's finance director Lars Lundquist told an RFTV interview.</p>
</text>
